Greetings from **LoopLayer Design!**

We specialize in professional embroidery digitizing and vector artwork, helping embroidery businesses, apparel brands, and promotional suppliers achieve exceptional production results.

Our experienced team focuses on precision stitch mapping, optimized density, clean underlay, and efficient stitch sequencing to deliver **high-quality, production-ready embroidery files**.

**Why Choose Us?**
- Expert manual digitizing
- Clean stitches and optimized machine performance
- Fast and reliable turnaround
- Consistent quality control
- Competitive pricing and bulk order support

Whether you need a single design or ongoing production support, we're ready to help.

**Allow us to work on your next design. We'd love to demonstrate our quality!**

**Regards**

**Looplayer Design**

